# {{ sec_num }}. {{ sec_heading }}

### {{ sec_num }}.1 Methodology, Core-to-Log Alignment & Petrophysical Equations

* **Lithology Model:** `{{ litho_params.model_name }}`
* **Porosity Model:** `{{ poro_params.method_name }}`{% if poro_params.use_hc_corrected %} with light-hydrocarbon invasion fluid correction and clay-bound water ($CBW$) partitioning{% else %} with clay-bound water ($CBW$) partitioning{% endif %}.
* **Core-to-Log Calibration Scope:** Total RCA core plugs loaded $= {{ poro_params.total_core_count }}$; valid target-zone plugs (`{{ target_zones|join(', ') }}`) with overlapping depth-matched log porosity used in regression $= {{ poro_params.core_count }}$.

{% if litho_params.model_key == 'multi_mineral' %}
$$\sum_i V_{min,i} + \phi_t = 1, \quad \rho_{ma} = \frac{\sum_i V_{min,i} \cdot \rho_i}{\sum_i V_{min,i}}, \quad \phi_D = \frac{\rho_{ma} - \rho_b}{\rho_{ma} - \rho_{fl}}, \quad \phi_e = \phi_t - V_{sh} \cdot \phi_{sh}$$
{% elif litho_params.model_key == 'vsh_gr' %}
$$I_{GR} = \frac{GR - GR_{clean}}{GR_{shale} - GR_{clean}}, \quad \phi_D = \frac{\rho_{ma} - \rho_b}{\rho_{ma} - \rho_{fl}}, \quad \phi_e = \phi_t - V_{sh} \cdot \phi_{sh}$$
{% else %}
$$V_{sand} + V_{silt} + V_{clay} + \phi_t = 1, \quad \phi_D = \frac{\rho_{ma} - \rho_b}{\rho_{ma} - \rho_{fl}}, \quad \phi_e = \phi_t - V_{clay} \cdot \phi_{sh}$$
{% endif %}

