{% if poro_params.core_shift_applied %}
> **Core-to-Log Depth Matching Lineage:** Driller's core plug depths were depth-matched to wireline logs using **{{ poro_params.core_shift_mode_label }}** ($\Delta d = {{ "%+.2f"|format(poro_params.core_shift_delta) }}\text{ m}$, stretch factor $s = {{ "%.4f"|format(poro_params.core_stretch_factor) }}\times${% if poro_params.core_pivot_depth %}, anchor pivot $d_{ref} = {{ "%.1f"|format(poro_params.core_pivot_depth) }}\text{ m}${% endif %}, mean plug shift $= {{ "%+.2f"|format(poro_params.core_shift_mean_m) }}\text{ m}$). Original unshifted driller's depths (`RAW_DEPTH`) and per-plug shifts (`SHIFT_M`) are preserved on every RCA sample, while unshifted log-grid curves are retained as `CPORE_UNSHIFTED` and `CPERM_UNSHIFTED`.
{% endif %}
{% if poro_params.core_corrected %}
> **Core Overburden & Klinkenberg Lineage:** Ambient laboratory core porosity and gas permeability were corrected to reservoir stress ($\sigma_{eff} = {{ "%.0f"|format(poro_params.net_confining_stress) }}\text{ psi}$, $P_m = {{ "%.1f"|format(poro_params.mean_pore_pressure) }}\text{ psi}$, `{{ poro_params.core_lithology }}` compaction). Uncorrected baseline curves are preserved as `CPORE_AMB` / `CPORE_ORI` and `CPERM_AIR` / `CPERM_ORI`, while active evaluation curves `CPORE` and `CPERM` store reservoir-corrected values{% if poro_params.core_poro_amb_mean and poro_params.core_poro_res_mean %} ($\bar{\phi}_{amb} = {{ "%.3f"|format(poro_params.core_poro_amb_mean) }} \to \bar{\phi}_{res} = {{ "%.3f"|format(poro_params.core_poro_res_mean) }}\text{ v/v}${% if poro_params.core_perm_air_mean and poro_params.core_perm_liq_mean %}, $\bar{K}_{air} = {{ "%.1f"|format(poro_params.core_perm_air_mean) }} \to \bar{K}_{liq} = {{ "%.1f"|format(poro_params.core_perm_liq_mean) }}\text{ mD}${% endif %}){% endif %}.
